OL,3,GNEWSAThe hero dinner lady who died
OL,4,Asaving five children in the Aberfan
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Apparently she was holding as much of
OL,8,Fus as she could, and trying to get us
OL,9,Funder a table," said Aberfan survivor
OL,10,FPaul Harries, who has spoken to the
OL,11,Fmedia for the first time.
